<title>JAPAN: Japan 1996 overall WPI rises 0.7 pct--BOJ.</title>
<headline>Japan 1996 overall WPI rises 0.7 pct--BOJ.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's overall wholesale prices rose 0.7 percent in 1996, but domestic prices, a key component of the overall wholesale price index (WPI), fell 0.8 percent, the Bank of Japan said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The following is a breakdown of the 1996 WPI:</p>
<p>	     1996     1995</p>
<p> Overall   +0.7     -1.0</p>
<p> Domestic  -0.8     -0.8</p>
<p> Exports   +6.9     -2.2</p>
<p> Imports   +9.6     -0.1</p>
</text>
